{"version":1,"content":"<p>大約1.2億年前的早白堊世，今天哥倫比亞中部所在的海域曾經生活着一個異常複雜的海洋生態羣落。長頸蛇頸龍、遠古海洋鱷類、海龜、鯊魚以及各種甲殼類動物共同構成了一張高度複雜的食物網。令人驚訝的是，這個生態系統不僅擁有種類繁多的海洋生物，還同時存在多個處於食物鏈頂端的大型掠食者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585014.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:45:52.439079+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:35:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.336701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.336701+00:00","content_hash":"0589d17323b48558041d9da602144a1eb62a6ad01e3dffe6713c89a064e27d1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}